{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>吳宗憲近來傳出脫手名下3間台北市精華地段房產，據「東森新聞」報導，3間房產包括位於信義路坪數高達137坪的生技公司辦公室、內湖區兒子鹿希派（吳睿軒）的住處和工作室，大動作引發外界質疑，認為他有可能是因為出現財務危機，才需要變賣求現，對此，吳宗憲也回應了。</p><p>對於是否賣房救急，吳宗憲親自否認，表示單純是想靈活運用資產和業務擴大需求，因為生技公司需要更大的空間，決定搬到內湖500坪的辦公室，才會決定賣掉信義區的商辦，粗估有2千到3千萬（台幣，下同，約477萬到715萬港元）的獲利，至於鹿希派的住處也是因為想換到更大的空間，鹿希派證實最近就要搬家。</p><figure><img alt=\"吳宗憲解釋近來傳出脫手名下3間房產原因。（FB@吳宗憲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250729/1027008468755681280123495.jpeg/hqiFGElTZmCmORX6i2hWUO262-2xifPQcUNdhHFDXYQ\"/><figcaption>吳宗憲解釋近來傳出脫手名下3間房產原因。（FB@吳宗憲）</figcaption></figure><p>更多吳宗憲照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"對於是否賣房救急，吳宗憲親自否認，表示單純是想靈活運用資產和業務擴大需求。（IG@jacky_wu60）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194620006172725248892753.jpeg/TW0LnSfo6RB0OaxRvX3xpDEfYkse5RevIL5ZHiC-WR4\"/><figcaption>對於是否賣房救急，吳宗憲親自否認，表示單純是想靈活運用資產和業務擴大需求。（IG@jacky_wu60）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳宗憲曾邀請安苡愛到內湖豪宅留宿。（安苡愛IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3052245/org/30a2ec45602bcc63aae4a52b1c5d9e03.jpg/8osgZCuBRIPaiB3RMqbBcMSUFnNPZHwfPdmmAD3ZpgA\"/><figcaption>吳宗憲曾邀請安苡愛到內湖豪宅留宿。（安苡愛IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳宗憲（IG@jacky_wu60）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194620008517472256106438.jpeg/8jUq-6kTP61_yRRfdmWAswx5ZV6D3QQ7uu40yLruNMg\"/><figcaption>吳宗憲（IG@jacky_wu60）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳宗憲（IG@jacky_wu60）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194620010929328128564270.jpeg/zs5NNHeJ3PMFD8vIzrlkQoSxQfMqc-DDdheHNnYXhzY\"/><figcaption>吳宗憲（IG@jacky_wu60）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳宗憲（IG@jacky_wu60）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194620013148246016358206.jpeg/n0f14mY8ci65J8o1rfWY2alvI8tuaNMaCcrSWQnK0lk\"/><figcaption>吳宗憲（IG@jacky_wu60）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳宗憲（jacky_wu60@IG）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251114/1065961641029406720561238.jpeg/6Rf1ohHWxKeYnUuhLVdoL9Ff8f9XfsNf32Cn1t9gp9Y\"/><figcaption>吳宗憲（jacky_wu60@IG）</figcaption></figure><p>「東森新聞」報導吳宗憲理財有道，在台北市擁有多處黃金地段房產，包括價值1.92億（約4577萬港元）的敦南豪宅、4到5億（約9500萬到1.2億港元）的東區黃金店面，還有信義區及內湖區等地，名下房產總價值粗估超過10億元（約2.4億港元），身家驚人。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：吳宗憲喜曬鹿希派與她合照　兒子被傳娶老婆好事近？憲哥回應了】吳宗憲分享和兒子鹿希派與鼎惠惠的合照。（Facebook@吳宗憲 Jacky Wu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486459966722048894310.jpeg/k9NXs8PLp4dksHZIc-rRD6YlHZDAuo5S3x_hSN8f4Ug\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：吳宗憲喜曬鹿希派與她合照　兒子被傳娶老婆好事近？憲哥回應了】吳宗憲分享和兒子鹿希派與鼎惠惠的合照。（Facebook@吳宗憲 Jacky Wu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鹿希派與鼎惠惠的合照（Facebook@吳宗憲 Jacky Wu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486462743482368327569.jpeg/HOe1896rtH9WQaO3r6YwCF9n0iH15IFyY-rvtWPq77U\"/><figcaption>鹿希派與鼎惠惠的合照（Facebook@吳宗憲 Jacky Wu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486465000148992342869.jpeg/lC6Y3N3BfxRjtDNjUHMHcGaY28G6xSknqK3a56it2uc\"/><figcaption>鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486467806269440072536.jpeg/tHk7Kd--0TX_1JoVLUX5wfrioWPSbcWDFrl2nRa5dp0\"/><figcaption>鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486470226513920176325.jpeg/B8dMSXo0bXJ5g5DeCfvmJ-BaC91Jbdj70DnyX9A58l8\"/><figcaption>鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486472583843840072914.jpeg/xLuOV7oDmrQBw6zBEPMnmmokETtNYTH9D_Dyzw_w8s8\"/><figcaption>鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486475104751616825019.jpeg/iihmxVHeNtJElYdZpvJ5S4YVryxdigwrv43uT7-N7k8\"/><figcaption>鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486477579522048487203.jpeg/oia4-nwnSF6baif37UA0Xzd0DHRJ2AVN0LOJjNCziYw\"/><figcaption>鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486480083652608302614.jpeg/XECL5tPZ08iG2QB1cR4EoE6C20oxmDu-rUhBB61IQQc\"/><figcaption>鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486482797498368213864.jpeg/HSeCm6zODoBoZbyV7n1HuuTF_H7VvonH60QawOtEGsA\"/><figcaption>鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231104/797486458070896640348905.jpeg/m4MxkeFOi4HQxOGgToIuOGEHv1bo0RPuo586raOfOq0\"/><figcaption>鼎惠惠（IG@venus____1010）</figcaption></figure><p>星級評論／吳宗憲胡瓜縱橫電視30年 退休、交棒各自掙扎</p><p>星級評論／不甩吳宗憲、超車黃子佼 曾國城默默成為「綜藝之王」</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:42:22.921150+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":981,"images":18,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:30:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:51.624732+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:35:35.088348+00:00","content_hash":"c6a5c6acb457412ffec19fc7429a562bd009f1e898a6e472f50ff7006d244a71","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}